@AccessRequestHub.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5149

### Get all access requests
GET {{AccessRequestHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-requests
Accept: application/json
X-User-Email: erin@example.local

###

### Get specific access request
GET {{AccessRequestHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-requests/1
Accept: application/json
X-User-Email: alice@example.local

###

### Get pending approvals for user
GET {{AccessRequestHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/approvals
Accept: application/json
X-User-Email: bob@example.local

###

### Create access request
POST {{AccessRequestHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-requests
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Email: alice@example.local

{
  "clientRequestId": "req-123",
  "applicationId": 1,
  "environment": "NonProduction",
  "accessLevel": "Read",
  "justification": "Need access"
}

###

### Approve access request
POST {{AccessRequestHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-requests/1/approve
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Email: bob@example.local

###

### Reject access request
POST {{AccessRequestHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-requests/1/reject
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Email: bob@example.local

{
  "reason": "Not enough justification"
}
